==== hyperbricks yaml {!{html}} ====
html:
  - type: html
  - enclose: <div>|</div>
  - value: |2
      <p>HTML TEST</p>
==== explainer ====
Component for rendering all your single or multiline snippets.
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HTML>",
  "Enclose": "<div>|</div>",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "TrimSpace": false,
  "Value": "<p>HTML TEST</p>\n"
}

==== expected output ====
<div><p>HTML TEST</p></div>
